{"id":"wb-6-931","name":"国民大会堂旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南京人民大会堂","text":"南京人民大会堂，位于江苏省南京市玄武区长江路264号，坐北朝南，钢筋水泥结构，地上4层，建筑面积5,100平方米，建成于1936年。原为国民大会堂，是中华民国行宪后召开国民大会之场所。渡江战役后，中国人民解放军占领南京，后改为现名。如今这里是每年南京市人大、政协全体会议的召开场所，亦在平时充当演艺场所使用。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E4%BA%AC%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%A4%A7%E4%BC%9A%E5%A0%82","revisionId":94028537,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94028537","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e81360088d7e9245025cd7f2.jpg","title":"南京国民大会堂旧址2021.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8D%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E5%A4%A7%E4%BC%9A%E5%A0%82%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%802021.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/%E5%8D%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E5%A4%A7%E4%BC%9A%E5%A0%82%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%802021.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ScareCriterion12","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​南京市玄武区长江路264号 国民大会堂旧址","width":320,"height":221,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"南京人民大会堂"}}